# m4_early: A at 30, then UP briefly and RIGHT into the y-40 gnat string: hit at update 84
# (game tick 54), less than 120 ticks of history, so the rewind goes back to tick 0. Since M5
# the playback length follows the depth, (54 + 1) / 2 = 27 frames: bug report 85..103 (20
# updates with 84), playback 104..130 (game tick 52, 50, ... 0), resume at update 131 with
# game tick 0 and rewinds 2.
--frames 400 --dump-exports debug_state,debug_rewinds,debug_game_tick --at "84 debug_state == 4" --at "84 debug_rewind_target == 0" --at "130 debug_state == 4" --at "130 debug_game_tick == 0" --at "131 debug_state == 1" --at "131 debug_game_tick == 0" --at "131 debug_rewinds == 2" --at "250 debug_history_check == 0" --expect "debug_state == 1"
